        "node_id": "n_1_0d0af0",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Iterate through all possible times before the target time and check for the presence of the digit '7'. Start from the target time and move backwards, checking each minute until a lucky time is found. Once a lucky time is identified, calculate how many times the snooze button needs to be pressed to reach the target time from that lucky time.",
