        "node_id": "n_2_1ef5e8",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Ensure that the current time remains within the valid 24-hour format (00:00 to 23:59) during each iteration of the loop. Adjust the calculation of `current_time` to wrap around using modulo operations when it goes below zero. Additionally, add a check to break out of the loop once a lucky time is found, rather than continuing indefinitely.",
