        "node_id": "n_3_b05fd8",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Instead of decrementing the current time directly, calculate the difference between the target time and the current time, ensuring it wraps around using modulo arithmetic. This approach ensures that the calculation remains within valid time bounds and simplifies the logic for finding the next lucky time.",
